[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2761.27, "timestamp": "00:46:01", "text": "。我們玩得很開心。好的。  渾身是傷，起不來了。兄弟，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2764.71, "timestamp": "00:46:04", "text": "我需要更多子彈。  子彈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2776.309, "timestamp": "00:46:16", "text": "他們在哪裡？  肯定是你的蛋蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.19, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "的。炸彈已安放。  沒有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2799.67, "timestamp": "00:46:39", "text": "哦，是我先開的槍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2802.23, "timestamp": "00:46:42", "text": "我的"}]